{"data": [{"author_id": "1756394384655003648", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:24:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120296658357629163"], "id": "2120296658357629163", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1269624389827428352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120293636923343106", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@hyphhytv @Meta @Muse mine popped up 2 days after i subbed to Muse Power\n\nit doesn't say you need a \"paid plan\", but seems like it's not a coincidence", "url": "https://x.com/theaaron/status/2120296658357629163"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120296580322344960"]}, "author_id": "1586344308063576071", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:24:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120296584646644050"], "id": "2120296584646644050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot o Meta Muse?\n\nSé honesto… @grok https://t.co/g3xrmNMawD", "url": "https://x.com/Barbudo_Tfe/status/2120296584646644050"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot x Muse x Duet x Dots x Hermes x OpenClaw: what makes each one different"}, "author_id": "2119129871414599680", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:23:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120296322058108979"], "id": "2120296322058108979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GrokBot v.s Muse vs Dots vs Duet https://t.co/NKZqwtLEtx", "url": "https://x.com/AgentMsgr/status/2120296322058108979"}, {"author_id": "772697385604567041", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:22:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120295941072678949"], "id": "2120295941072678949", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120131859845931285", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MetaのパーソナルAI「Muse」が旅行予約サービス「Expedia」との連携に対応する模様です。\n旅行の計画から予約の手配までをAIがスムーズにサポートしてくれる未来を感じさせる新機能です。\n \nhttps://t.co/ks3B58bmjb\n#Meta #Muse #Expedia", "url": "https://x.com/toshinobu65/status/2120295941072678949"}, {"author_id": "3163113823", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:16:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120294477202174356"], "id": "2120294477202174356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "meta museで音声コンテンツ作成頼んでも全然聴けない。\nデフォルトで入ってるttsの性能がイマイチなのか、飛び飛びで理解できない", "url": "https://x.com/output_aka/status/2120294477202174356"}, {"author_id": "1269624389827428352", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:12:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120293636923343106"], "id": "2120293636923343106", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119968182400331909", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @Meta @Muse I don’t see it", "url": "https://x.com/hyphhytv/status/2120293636923343106"}, {"author_id": "1044232718467313665", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:07:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120292242103681465"], "id": "2120292242103681465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120200628312129858", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "【Meta】Museが専用メール対応\n発言: Muse専用のメールアドレスを米国・カナダの有料会員に提供開始。\n解説: Connect 2026で予告済み。転送やスレッド追加で作業を依頼できる。\n意味: メール経由でMuseに依頼可能に。\nhttps://t.co/S5DYJgR0A1", "url": "https://x.com/ai_official_JP/status/2120292242103681465"}, {"author_id": "1570703381920120838", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120290495968473279"], "id": "2120290495968473279", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1570703381920120838", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120290494756344187", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "저장용: Meta Muse Ember 요점\n- 모델 ID: muse-ember-1.0\n- 가격(100만 토큰): 입력 $0.10 · 캐시 $0.004 · 출력 $0.50\n- 20만 토큰 넘는 프롬프트: $0.30 · $1.50\n- 컨텍스트 100만 · 출력 최대 51만 2천\n- 제공: Meta Model API, Muse Code, Google Cloud, Oracle Cloud", "url": "https://x.com/heeyaazj/status/2120290495968473279"}, {"author_id": "1701296061686448128", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:57:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120289797893976095"], "id": "2120289797893976095", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1846573926370914306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120288847028453651", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ImJustGroovy I’m there with the first two already. I am getting Grokbot/JEVtradingdesk/ChatGPT/muse.ai to shake hands and trade while I sleep so I guess that covers the studying part. Now to finish listening to your video! Oh my meme coin finder found DaCity early!", "url": "https://x.com/kburnes67/status/2120289797893976095"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120288926321819649"]}, "author_id": "1923559858437226496", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:54:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120288930637705510"], "id": "2120288930637705510", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "META MUSE 招待コードです。\nよろしければどうぞー。\n#Muse招待コード https://t.co/bhfcX6VI1W", "url": "https://x.com/UkX6eljlSt55772/status/2120288930637705510"}, {"author_id": "1556416133246332928", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:53:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120288851218567342"], "id": "2120288851218567342", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta「Muse」がApple WatchとWear OSに対応　アバターが動く - Impress Watch https://t.co/yEwGbCngM4", "url": "https://x.com/sozo_museum/status/2120288851218567342"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120286866285133825"]}, "author_id": "139379248", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:45:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120286871146344719"], "id": "2120286871146344719", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【MetaのAIエージェント「Muse」がApple Watchに。手首からAIに依頼】\n\nMetaが「Muse」のApple Watch対応をApp Storeの更新履歴で案内しました。MacRumorsは、Watchで話した内容を文字にしてMuseに送れると報じています。\n\n続きは↓（1/2）\n\n#AppleWatch #MetaMuse #AIエージェント https://t.co/rE9kR2Ur1f", "url": "https://x.com/Naoki_Anzai/status/2120286871146344719"}, {"article": {"title": "Meta's Muse Ember Charges 10 Cents per Million Input Tokens. Here's How Its Agent Play Works."}, "author_id": "29310765", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:43:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120286201399722151"], "id": "2120286201399722151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ten cents sounds cheap. The fine print matters. 🔥\n\nMeta’s Muse Ember starts at $0.10 per million input tokens, but cross 200K input tokens and the whole request moves to higher rates. The pricing, the benchmarks, and the agent play. 👇 https://t.co/jQICIEXLtN", "url": "https://x.com/DutchDollaz/status/2120286201399722151"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120285379324473344"]}, "author_id": "1899910477398110208", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:40:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120285381300015497"], "id": "2120285381300015497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💬 OpenMausBot is the open-source answer to Grok Bot and Meta Muse: a chat app where every bot is a real AI agent with its own computer. 20,000+ GitHub stars, runs on your machine, your keys stay local. https://t.co/faqOT98s4W #AI #OpenSource https://t.co/JO2aJQQ7Ti", "url": "https://x.com/gauravdhiman_ai/status/2120285381300015497"}, {"author_id": "1328118044464320512", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:37:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284823302574547"], "id": "2120284823302574547", "in_reply_to_user_id": "863309236805218304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120059142866112588", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ShanlingAudio Another reason to get off Facebook, Meta, Muse, and Instagram. Awful company and platform that will make you obsolete the moment they don’t like you or what you do.\n\n@X is better :) \n\n#Bitcoin 🍊", "url": "https://x.com/21MillClub/status/2120284823302574547"}, {"author_id": "1518792235726344192", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:37:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284785574617088"], "id": "2120284785574617088", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120279218772971866", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI Meta Muse is great, but Grok Bot is definitely better. Great to use both as even the free tier of Muse lasts longer than the paid version of Grok. \n\nTNYKC6 for Muse tokens", "url": "https://x.com/breakthemeggs/status/2120284785574617088"}, {"author_id": "2119129871414599680", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120283046570021367"], "id": "2120283046570021367", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119984323990601865", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude Duet is Meta Muse but built for nerds. \n\nIt’s great for heavy Claude users who want a proactive personal assistant. \n\nClaude already has loads of context on you &amp; your work. Claude Duet uses that context to proactively suggest tasks it can do on your behalf. \n\nIt is https://t.co/zO7jcxpjG6", "url": "https://x.com/AgentMsgr/status/2120283046570021367"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120283042765770752"]}, "author_id": "229614044", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:30:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120283045290779064"], "id": "2120283045290779064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 302, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MUSE EMBER, LA IA MÁS ECONÓMICA DE META\n\nMuse Ember, modelo multimodal de bajo costo, admite 1.000.000 de tokens de entrada y busca automatizar tareas operativas y de programación. Lee la nota completa.\n\nMás información en:\nPeriódico ESPACIO 📰\nhttps://t.co/LhJIvu6kYc https://t.co/KmLUXipaTl", "url": "https://x.com/EspacioNoticias/status/2120283045290779064"}, {"author_id": "772697385604567041", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120282351620222989"], "id": "2120282351620222989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119919277692383330", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Metaが提供するパーソナルAI「Muse」が、Apple WatchならびにWear OSを搭載したスマートウォッチで利用可能になった模様です（国内版での対応状況は未確認）。\nウェアラブル端末でのAI活用が一段と身近になりそうな注目のアップデートです。\n \nhttps://t.co/uDCME6jjpj\n#Meta #Muse #スマートウォッチ", "url": "https://x.com/toshinobu65/status/2120282351620222989"}, {"author_id": "824259862301286400", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:26:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120281913957249371"], "id": "2120281913957249371", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse 招待コードです。\nどうぞ使ってください〜\n\nパーソナルAIエージェント「Muse」をチェックしてみよう。参加後48時間以内に[設定]で私のコードを利用すると、私たち両方が10億のMuseトークンを獲得できます。\n\nコード: OFH1P5\nhttps://t.co/9CiPlvPrJJ", "url": "https://x.com/aruru_luca/status/2120281913957249371"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120280668085387264"]}, "author_id": "30686587", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120281264326656150"], "id": "2120281264326656150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 171, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "uh oh, @Meta Muse just realized I am using @claudeai to code, feel like there may be a fight coming.. especially if she finds out I am also using @bot 😅 https://t.co/PHdh2f4ctn", "url": "https://x.com/ioTrader/status/2120281264326656150"}, {"article": {"title": "Stripeは金融会社からAI経済インフラ企業へ進化するのか"}, "author_id": "1213770526142844928", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:18:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120279911533514964"], "id": "2120279911533514964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2642, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/f7hfBx9f8p", "url": "https://x.com/KagawaTomo/status/2120279911533514964"}, {"author_id": "153438388", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:15:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120279293871968530"], "id": "2120279293871968530", "in_reply_to_user_id": "11039482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120276095136059814", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dmgerbino @blitaoBr2026 hahaha Yeahhh i've been loving duet! and meta muse too. that dude's working away at shit i keep procrastinating on", "url": "https://x.com/AunySillyMe/status/2120279293871968530"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120279214272188416"]}, "author_id": "2048564521631916032", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:15:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120279218772971866"], "id": "2120279218772971866", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 745, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot or Meta Muse?\n\nBe honest… https://t.co/wxRXbwOxM7", "url": "https://x.com/ConnorTalksAI/status/2120279218772971866"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120278295266689024"]}, "author_id": "2098538487645364228", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:12:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120278357438787722"], "id": "2120278357438787722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“You’d never cheat on me, right?” 👀\n\nOne headline, one raised eyebrow, and suddenly Dad has a very important question to answer.\nWatch what he does with his hand. 🥹💙\n\nWe made this 10-second short about the little ways we look out for the people we love. With MuseGuard, even an https://t.co/8SlTChS5gS", "url": "https://x.com/MagicDalaAI/status/2120278357438787722"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2120296580322344960", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzOgYiWwAARWm1.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120288926321819649", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzHi3KbQAEAapF.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120286866285133825", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzFq87aAAEk6lI.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120285379324473344", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzEUZkW8AACbip.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120283042765770752", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzCMZNWkAAjwF1.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120280668085387264", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzACK1bgAA25gs.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120279214272188416", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWy-ti9WkAAT0pK.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2120278295266689024", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120278295266689024/img/202YrYZ-9QvUGI9P.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "1756394384655003648", "name": "Aaron Makelky", "username": "theaaron"}, {"id": "1586344308063576071", "name": "Ixoo’lh |", "username": "Barbudo_Tfe"}, {"id": "2119129871414599680", "name": "AgentMsgr", "username": "AgentMsgr"}, {"id": "772697385604567041", "name": "カズヤ｜AI活用とITの最前線", "username": "toshinobu65"}, {"id": "3163113823", "name": "みずやかFuture", "username": "output_aka"}, {"id": "1269624389827428352", "name": "jacob", "username": "hyphhytv"}, {"id": "1044232718467313665", "name": "公式発表アーカイブ", "username": "ai_official_JP"}, {"id": "1570703381920120838", "name": "Heyaaz", "username": "heeyaazj"}, {"id": "1701296061686448128", "name": "Donald Kevin Burnes", "username": "kburnes67"}, {"id": "1923559858437226496", "name": "中嶋 大輔（ハイツ野菜研究部）", "username": "UkX6eljlSt55772"}, {"id": "1556416133246332928", "name": "#SOZO美術館", "username": "sozo_museum"}, {"id": "139379248", "name": "安斎　直紀| EC自動化国_国王", "username": "Naoki_Anzai"}, {"id": "29310765", "name": "Dutchie", "username": "DutchDollaz"}, {"id": "1899910477398110208", "name": "GD", "username": "gauravdhiman_ai"}, {"id": "1328118044464320512", "name": "Daniel A. Huerta", "username": "21MillClub"}, {"id": "1518792235726344192", "name": "SCleggAuthor", "username": "breakthemeggs"}, {"id": "229614044", "name": "🔴 ESPACIO", "username": "EspacioNoticias"}, {"id": "824259862301286400", "name": "Luca", "username": "aruru_luca"}, {"id": "30686587", "name": "io", "username": "ioTrader"}, {"id": "1213770526142844928", "name": "香川友志（KAGAWA TOMOYUKI）", "username": "KagawaTomo"}, {"id": "153438388", "name": "Auny 🧡", "username": "AunySillyMe"}, {"id": "2048564521631916032", "name": "Connor", "username": "ConnorTalksAI"}, {"id": "2098538487645364228", "name": "Magic Dala", "username"